      "id": "q1",
      "answer": "Vitest is a Vite-powered testing framework: test suites, assertions, snapshots, mocks/spies, watch mode, coverage, browser/component tests and benchmarks. Developers import test APIs from vitest and run npx vitest; repository CI scripts run its suites. Programmatic Node consumers can import createVitest/startVitest and parseCLI from vitest/node.",
