    {
      "id": "q3",
      "answer": "A pnpm workspace monorepo spans packages/*, docs, examples/* and test/*. Evidenced implementation/build languages are TypeScript and JavaScript, with JSON manifests and YAML workspace configuration; the UI uses Vue tooling. Packages have ESM/export-map boundaries and declaration outputs. Root scripts orchestrate builds/tests, tsc checks types, and oxlint/oxfmt check style. Vitest's Rollup config bundles TS entry points using Oxc, emits ESM and declarations plus a CJS config entry. Browser/UI clients use Vite builds. This is not an exhaustive language census.",
